# Build context for apps/server/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile (both use
# the repo root as context, because the pnpm workspace and lockfile live here).
#
# Everything is rebuilt inside the image, so local build output and installs
# are excluded — a stale dist/ copied in would mask a broken build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/stats.html
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
infra/env/*.env
infra/secrets
backups
coverage
playwright-report
test-results
tests
fixtures
docs
*.log
